tal Heart Disease ( CPT codes 93593, 93594, 93595, 93596, 93597, 93598)","5":"Endomyocardial Biopsy (CPT Code 93505)","6":"Extra-Cardiac Angiography (CPT Codes 75625, 75630, 75705, 75710, 75716 and 36140, 36200, 36215-36218, 36245-36248, 36251-36254 Performed During the Same Encounter as Cardiac Catheterization The ICD-10 code list below applies to these procedures only when related to provisions in this LCD."},"noncovered":{}}}]